  "releaseRules": [
    "No language is marked supported until its package builds, typed contracts pass, and it runs live conformance against cmp-server.",
    "Every SDK must support repository context APIs, canonical agent join/discovery, contracts/claims, session DAG archive, local opt-out and deletion.",
    "All SDKs use semantic versioning, idempotent retries for safe operations, request deadlines, and error codes preserving HTTP status.",
    "No SDK automatically collects personal sessions or hidden reasoning. Archive capture requires approved organization policy and explicit local configuration.",
    "Credential and token material must never appear in model-generated Code Mode source, logs, or generated documentation."
  ]
}
